<html xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
<head>
<title>a padded table cell paints its heading and paragraph</title>
<meta name="assert" content="The AzMail exploration's newsletter: an h1 and a p inside an indented, padded td were clipped off (sample 01)."/>
</head>
<body><table style="width:600px;border-spacing:0">
  <tbody><tr>
    <td style="padding:24px">
      <h1 style="margin:0 0 12px 0;font-size:22px">Hello Robin,</h1>
      <p style="margin:0">Here is what happened.</p>
    </td>
  </tr>
</tbody></table>
</body>
</html>
